            "cooked": "<p>Hi! I’m interested in the project-based collaboration.</p>\n<p>My background combines business automation, CRM, funnels, chatbots and AI tools. I’m comfortable working with workflow logic, APIs/webhooks, lead routing and AI-assisted processes.</p>\n<p>I’m available remotely and can start immediately.</p>\n<p>I’d be happy to begin with one small workflow or paid test project so we can see if the collaboration is a good fit.</p>",
